sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Χρήστης
    participant B as Browser
    box Tomcat
        participant FC as StudentFormController
        participant FJ as student-form.jsp
        participant R as StudentRepository
        participant LC as StudentListController
        participant LJ as student-list.jsp
    end

    U->>B: πατά «Νέος φοιτητής»
    B->>FC: GET /studentlab/students/new
    FC->>FJ: doGet → forward
    FJ-->>B: 200 OK (HTML φόρμα)

    U->>B: συμπληρώνει και πατά «Αποθήκευση»
    B->>FC: POST /studentlab/students/new<br/>name=…, surname=…, email=…
    FC->>FC: doPost: getParameter(...) και έλεγχος
    FC->>R: save(student)
    FC-->>B: 302 Found<br/>Location: /studentlab/students

    Note over B: Ο browser κάνει μόνος του νέο GET (redirect)

    B->>LC: GET /studentlab/students
    LC->>R: findAll()
    R-->>LC: λίστα φοιτητών
    LC->>LJ: setAttribute("students", ...) → forward
    LJ-->>B: 200 OK (HTML πίνακας)
